{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793730268687130823,"compiled_state":{"alias":"individual-sonorous-snake","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":2},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793725895836000001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6f125f81-e28a-4911-961b-891dd50b1162","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"467d-e068-ee33-4bad"}],"description":"## Problem\nThe compaction sweep's log, /var/gerrit/site/.rebar/logs/compact-worker.log inside the rebar-mcp container, is not on a volume. autodeploy.sh replaces the container on every src/rebar change (2-minute timer), so the log is discarded at each deploy. The Nov 1 PST sweep's log was lost this way, which left breezelike-travelsick-moray without per-phase production timings; Gerrit 3269 (f1fe7c6f587) added those timing lines, but they survive only until the next deploy.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The compact-worker log persists across a blue-green MCP deploy (on a mounted volume or forwarded to the journal like rebar-mcp's own log), with a test or config check that guards the location.\n- [ ] docs/mcp-client-setup.md troubleshooting (or the MCP runbook) names where to read it.\n- [ ] [non-codebase] After the next deploy, the log from the previous container is still readable.\n  provenance: production-equivalent / live-call","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ops-sweep"],"ticket_id":"4f4d-9a7a-3b2d-4b13","ticket_type":"bug","title":"compact-worker.log is wiped by every MCP deploy","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["683d008d-4fa3-4681-a90e-ef90add6acf5","6f125f81-e28a-4911-961b-891dd50b1162"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793730268687130823,"uuid":"9ba025ca-b520-4e9c-95c5-c26b2f5f8bc9"}